  {
    "id": 6023001090010,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "やは～♡\r\nプロデューサー！　雛菜、優勝した～～～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "023",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、見てたよ\r\n……おめでとう、雛菜",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090020,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "じゃあ、は～い♡\r\nお願いします～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え？　なんだ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "え～～～……\r\nプロデューサー、忘れちゃったの～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、だから何を──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "頑張ったら、雛菜のこといちばん褒めて、\r\n撫でてくれるって言った～～～！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは俺が言ったんじゃなくて\r\n雛菜が言ったんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～～～？　そうだっけ～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あ～！　じゃあ雛菜が\r\nプロデューサーのこと撫でてあげる～♡",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、ちょ…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "y": 50,
      "scale": 1.1,
      "time": 400
    },
    "se": "0454"
  },
  {
