    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "よしよし～♡",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090070"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……プロデューサーはここまで\r\nわがままな雛菜のプロデュースをよく頑張りました～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "023",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………\r\nそんなことないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雛菜は、いいアイドルだった\r\n……これからもずっとそうだろ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～、そうかな～？\r\nどうだろ～～～？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雛菜の幸せそうなところを見てたら\r\nみんなも幸せな気持ちになる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……雛菜が最初に言ってたとおりだった\r\nこれからもそういう人が、増えていくはずだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜のいちばん最初のファンの人が\r\nそう言ってくれるなら、そうなのかもね～～～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それは\r\n絶対、間違いないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～、そっか～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090110"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "………………\r\n雛菜ね～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090120"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ちょっと前に戻ったとしたら\r\n絶対にアイドルやらないほうがいいよって雛菜に言う！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "最初は褒めてもらえるけど～\r\nだんだん大変になっていくし～～～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "楽しくしあわせ～♡　にできたらそれでいいのに\r\nそうじゃないだろ～！　って言う人もいるし～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090150"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜の人生がすっごいすっごい変わっちゃうから、\r\nやめといたほうがいいよ～って言うの",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "──そしたらこれからも\r\n今の、雛菜だけの、プロデューサーでいてくれるでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090170"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "今ここにいる雛菜が、\r\nいちばん楽しくて、しあわせなのがいい～～～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あはは、雛菜らしいな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜のこういうとこ、多分変わらないけど～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090190"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "プロデューサー、これからも\r\n雛菜のこと頑張ってプロデュースしてね～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300109/6023001090200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、雛菜も頑張ってプロデュースされてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023001090210,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～♡　わかりました！\r\n楽しくしあわせ～に頑張る～～～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
